  "summary_en": "Preprint adapting Sociocracy 3.0 principles into a technical governance framework for multi-robot systems, with a three-tier consent protocol integrated into ROS 2. Evaluated on simulations and the DROID-100 dataset, it reports fewer coordination conflicts and better debuggability while scaling to about 12 robots before degradation.",
